=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/38024fd94f45957f91507b2d1e58d8b0.mp4?t=1757578859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The sexy and passionate restaurant owner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.poster.avif?t=1757578859\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.webm?t=1757578859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.mp4?t=1757578859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Suspense + Romance, the 'Chrysanthemum and the Sword']</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you're lingering in tender ambiguity, the next you're gasping, &quot;Who stabbed me in the back?!&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[High-Intensity Narrative + Highly Interactive Gameplay]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A professional production team delivers full cinematic quality. The suspenseful puzzle-solving will keep you focused, while the tense action sequences ensure the story's pace is perfectly balanced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Endings Feature Interwoven &quot;Dream Crossovers&quot;]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of branches lead to N types of lives. Among the dozen or so endings lie interconnected easter eggs. The more memory fragments you collect, the more you can uncover the hidden plot behind the main story\u2014even the endings themselves interact and intertwine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Interaction is More Than Just &quot;Choose A or B&quot;]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During investigation phases, details that can turn the tide are hidden within the scenes\u2014graffiti on a street corner, a special mark in a drawer, a seemingly ordinary diary... any could be the code to break the case.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Find Your Past, Piece Together Memories, Win Big or Restart\u2014The Choice is Yours]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the path to discovering your history, memory fragments are like puzzles scattered throughout the plot. As you piece them together, you encounter the &quot;so-this-is-how-crazy-I-was&quot; version of yourself. Just dive in and make your choices. Choose right, and you win big in Tokyo. Choose wrong? Just hit restart\u2014after all, a good story is never afraid of a few tries. Every restart is a new highlight moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/4ebeaafa0ed6dc5b5e92e8e6183ddfe5.avif?t=1757578859\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Terraflame Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/0b203ca93080349d4df49ca430e9bc6316f97649/header.jpg?t=1757578859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196059,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196059/movie480.mp4?t=1757578850","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196059/movie_max.mp4?t=1757578850"},"name":"\u4eba\u7269PV\u82f1\u8bed","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196059/57545ac8581e3e2f42ba68938a973de4e6e640a8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757578850","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c